@page: projects
@title: Projects · Vision Properties, Karachi
@desc: Every project Vision Properties markets, grouped by corridor: the DHA Phase VIII seafront, Jinnah Avenue, North Nazimabad, the M-9 Super Highway, malls and commercial, and across the city.
@head: <link rel="preload" as="image" href="images/ui/tower-marina.webp">
===CSS===
.phero .stage { --word-top: 20%; --th: 90%; --ta: .5145; --tx: 72%; }
@media (max-width: 860px) { .phero .stage { --tx: 64%; --th: 84%; --word-top: 26%; } }
.tools { position: sticky; top: calc(14px + var(--nav-h) + 12px); z-index: 40; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px; border-radius: var(--r-pill); margin-bottom: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px); transition: transform var(--dur-3) var(--ease-out); }
body.nav-hidden .tools { transform: translateY(calc(-1 * (var(--nav-h) + 12px))); }
.search { position: relative; flex: 0 0 280px; min-width: 0; }
.search svg { position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 50%; width: 17px; height: 17px; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--ink-3); pointer-events: none; }
.search .inp { height: 46px; border-radius: var(--r-pill); padding-left: 46px; }
.jump { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex: 1 1 0; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; min-width: 0; }
.jump::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.jump a { flex: none; height: 46px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: var(--r-pill); font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); transition: background-color var(--dur-2), color var(--dur-2); white-space: nowrap; }
.jump a:hover { color: var(--ink); background: var(--glass); }
.jump a.on { color: var(--btn-on-ink); background: var(--btn-ink); }
.jump a span { font: 500 11px/1 var(--font-mono); opacity: .6; }
.cnt-l { font: 500 12px/1 var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 0 14px; white-space: nowrap; }
@media (max-width: 860px) { .tools { position: relative; top: auto; border-radius: var(--r-lg); } .search { flex: 1 1 100%; } .jump { flex: 1 1 100%; } .cnt-l { display: none; } }
.grp { margin-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); scroll-margin-top: 170px; }
.grp[hidden] { display: none; }
.grp-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stroke); }
.grp-h .h3 { font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 36px); }
.grp-h p { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 14.5px; margin-top: 6px; max-width: 60ch; }
.grp-h .n { font: 500 12px/1 var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-3); white-space: nowrap; }
.grp .mrail { --cols: 4; --mcol: 76%; }
.grp .pc.hide { display: none; }
@media (max-width: 1100px) { .grp .mrail { --cols: 3; } }
.empty { display: none; padding: 48px 24px; text-align: center; border-radius: var(--r-lg); }
.empty.show { display: block; }
